# Example: test_dict.wcn

Nested map construction with string keys and enum keys.

## Schema

```
App = Config Config2

Config = {String : Int}/settings
BuildType = "Dev" | "Local" | "Deploy"
Config2 = {BuildType : String}/environments
```

## Construction

```
[:App [:Config {String:Int "0":0 "1":1}] [:Config2 {BuildType:String Dev:"dev" Local:"local" Deploy:"deploy"}]]
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var app = AppAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(app.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
